    "title": "Bicyclist Fatally Injured in Washington Park Crash, Portland Police Investigating - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Emily Nguyen ,\n1 days ago On Sunday around 6:30 p.m., a bicyclist died in a crash at Washington Park near Southwest Sacajawea Boulevard and Southwest Lewis and Clark Circle. Police said the adult male, who was not wearing a helmet, was riding a BMX-style bike with a group descending the hill when he tried to pass through a narrow gap between two boulders and crashed. The Portland Police Bureau’s Major Crash Team responded to investigate, according to the City of Portland. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
